# Absenta API Development Patterns

## 🚀 API Endpoint Conventions

### Standard HTTP Methods
```javascript
// GET - Retrieve data
app.get('/api/admin/siswa-perwakilan', getSiswaPerwakilan);

// POST - Create new resources
app.post('/api/attendance/submit', submitAttendance);

// PUT - Update existing resources
app.put('/api/admin/update-siswa/:id', updateSiswa);

// DELETE - Remove resources
app.delete('/api/admin/delete-siswa/:id', deleteSiswa);
```

